 fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="12" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="254.5078" x="1067.1292" y="1196.0217">Preserve red row and every raw reference</text><rect fill="#F7F7F7" height="34.584" rx="12.5" ry="12.5" style="stroke:#333333;stroke-width:1;" width="238.4316" x="1075.1672" y="1228.5413"/><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="12" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="218.4316" x="1085.1672" y="1250.6057">Do not trade safety for performance</text><ellipse cx="1194.3831" cy="1294.1252" fill="none" rx="11" ry="11" style="stroke:#000000;stroke-width:1;"/><ellipse cx="1194.3831" cy="1294.1252" fill="#FFFFFF" rx="6" ry="6" style="stroke:#000000;stroke-width:1;"/><polygon fill="#FFF2CC" points="983.189,1125.2729,1405.5771,1125.2729,1417.5771,1137.2729,1405.5771,1149.2729,983.189,1149.2729,971.189,1137.2729,983.189,1125.2729" style="stroke:#8A6D1D;stroke-width:1;stroke-linejoin:miter;stroke-miterlimit:10;"/><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="13.6372" x="1198.3831" y="1160.332">no</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="422.3882" x="983.189" y="1141.6477">Byte, DNS, route, resource, memory, failure, drop, and cleanup gates pass?</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="18.7935" x="1417.5771" y="1134.9634">yes</text><line style="stroke:#000000;stroke-width:1;" x1="956.189" x2="956.189" y1="60.0166" y2="2114.469"/><rect fill="#F7F7F7" height="34.584" rx="12.5" ry="12.5" style="stroke:#333333;stroke-width:1;" width="310.959" x="1675.1495" y="1347.1252"/><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="12" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="290.959" x="1685.1495" y="1369.1897">Build the closed parameter-family/candidate set</text><rect fill="#F7F7F7" height="49.168" rx="12.5" ry="12.5" style="stroke:#333333;stroke-width:1;" width="251.5977" x="1704.8302" y="1401.70